<title>CHINA: Shanghai to build 12 mln sq metres housing in 97.</title>
<headline>Shanghai to build 12 mln sq metres housing in 97.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai will build 12 million square metres of residential housing in 1997 against 12.3 million in 1996, the Business News said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In 1995, the city built 10 million squares worth of residential space, the newspaper said quoting figures issued by the municipal government. It gave no details.</p>
</text>
